WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:06.209
We've been talking a lot about what could
happen between now and the November election

00:00:06.209 --> 00:00:08.390
that could propel Donald Trump to reelection.

00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:12.190
Now, Trump is down dramatically in a number
of different polls to Joe Biden.

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:14.220
We're going to talk about it a little later.

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:16.010
Right now, Trump is losing among women.

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:17.490
Trump is losing young voters.

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:20.010
Trump's losing older voters, minority voters.

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:25.170
Trump's strong group is middle aged white
men, essentially.

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:27.619
But things can change very quickly.

00:00:27.619 --> 00:00:32.989
And there's a piece in The New York Times
by two doctors from the University of Pennsylvania,

00:00:32.989 --> 00:00:39.820
including Zeke Emanuel, outlining a scenario
where Donald Trump could force some version

00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:46.130
of a Corona virus vaccine into emergency use
in October, an October surprise, so to speak,

00:00:46.130 --> 00:00:48.670
and propel himself to reelection.

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:54.879
I would even add an alternative, which is
Donald Trump will take what is already a likely

00:00:54.879 --> 00:00:55.879
scenario.

00:00:55.879 --> 00:01:02.899
I mean, we a lot of reasonable, sober roadmaps
have said for months now we are sort of expecting

00:01:02.899 --> 00:01:07.400
it's like a 50 50, maybe even more likely
shot that there's an emergency use vaccine

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.510
for health care workers in the fall.

00:01:09.510 --> 00:01:13.480
Trump could simply try to take credit for
it, despite the fact that he would have absolutely

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:18.290
nothing to do with such a vaccine, because
dozens of vaccines have been under development

00:01:18.290 --> 00:01:22.210
since before Donald Trump was even taking
Corona virus seriously.

00:01:22.210 --> 00:01:28.299
Right now, there are more than 120 candidate
vaccines, ten of which are already in human

00:01:28.299 --> 00:01:29.299
trials.

00:01:29.299 --> 00:01:33.280
We have phase three trials starting in some
of those vaccines.

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:38.110
And from a mathematical perspective, it's
likely one of these vaccines is going to work

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:40.460
and it will have nothing to do with Donald
Trump.

00:01:40.460 --> 00:01:46.189
We have already seen, again, the expectation
from some of the big financial firms which

00:01:46.189 --> 00:01:47.960
think what you will about them.

00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:52.990
They tend to make analysis that are based,
in fact, many big financial firms and thinking

00:01:52.990 --> 00:01:59.710
about the economic recovery are expecting
that by October there will be some vaccine

00:01:59.710 --> 00:02:02.990
doses available for health care workers.

00:02:02.990 --> 00:02:08.929
And even if all of that fails, Donald Trump
could try to strong arm the FDA to approve

00:02:08.929 --> 00:02:11.769
something that's not really ready for approval.

00:02:11.769 --> 00:02:14.980
He'd need some pharma company to be complicit.

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:20.090
But the point of the op ed in The New York
Times is this is not completely inconceivable.

00:02:20.090 --> 00:02:23.800
And it would, of course, be very dangerous
if it's not actually the right time for a

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:25.950
vaccine to be approved.

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:30.769
But Donald Trump thinks that he could get
an electoral victory by announcing I got the

00:02:30.769 --> 00:02:34.499
vaccine before everybody else open up businesses.

00:02:34.499 --> 00:02:35.569
I fixed it.

00:02:35.569 --> 00:02:37.239
Let's go back to work.

00:02:37.239 --> 00:02:43.659
If that happened in mid or late October, it
could generate just enough confusion and craziness

00:02:43.659 --> 00:02:49.330
that Trump gets himself reelected, assuming
he suppresses the vote enough in November,

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:53.419
which is another aspect of the 2020 Trump
campaign, limiting the number of people who

00:02:53.419 --> 00:02:54.579
end up voting.

00:02:54.579 --> 00:02:58.809
So there are a couple of things that would
be important to understand if there were an

00:02:58.809 --> 00:03:00.569
emergency use vaccine in the fall.

00:03:00.569 --> 00:03:02.169
And I hope there is.

00:03:02.169 --> 00:03:07.420
It would in all likelihood only be available
to health care workers and maybe by the end

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:12.430
of the year we would start to see more doses
for some of the most vulnerable Americans.

00:03:12.430 --> 00:03:16.150
It would have nothing to do with Donald Trump
whatsoever.

00:03:16.150 --> 00:03:24.079
Number two, it is really important to also
understand that a lot of these vaccines even

00:03:24.079 --> 00:03:29.919
pre-date this corona virus in the sense that
there are vaccines developed for poultry that

00:03:29.919 --> 00:03:35.049
have been around for a while for corona virus
in poultry that are being tweaked.

00:03:35.049 --> 00:03:38.689
None of this stuff would have anything to
do with Donald Trump, but it doesn't matter

00:03:38.689 --> 00:03:40.079
because it's all optics.

00:03:40.079 --> 00:03:42.609
And what can he take credit for?

00:03:42.609 --> 00:03:49.790
And what's incredible to see is since the
start of coronavirus, we've seen anti AXA's

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:54.760
spout conspiracies about Bill Gates is the
reason why they wouldn't get a corona virus

00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:59.680
vaccine or whatever there is now in light
of this op ed.

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:05.010
There's a crowd of people now who are pro
vaccine but who are worried if.

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:09.930
A vaccine is pushed out in September or October
by Donald Trump's FDA, if it's approved by

00:04:09.930 --> 00:04:11.739
Trump's FDA.

00:04:11.739 --> 00:04:14.040
People are now legitimately worried.

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:15.790
Would it actually be safe?

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:20.229
Because Donald Trump has started to control
all sorts of regulatory agencies.

00:04:20.229 --> 00:04:23.710
They mostly are doing his bidding pro vaccine.

00:04:23.710 --> 00:04:24.919
People are worried.

00:04:24.919 --> 00:04:30.650
You know, if this is just a Trump stunt in
October, maybe it wouldn't actually be a safe

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:34.509
vaccine, which is an incredible thing to see
and think about.

00:04:34.509 --> 00:04:39.439
Last point I want to make from a perspective
of practicality.

00:04:39.439 --> 00:04:44.139
Donald Trump has already proven himself completely
incompetent and unfit to lead.

00:04:44.139 --> 00:04:48.699
And what's happened up to today justifies
his immediate and speedy removal from the

00:04:48.699 --> 00:04:50.710
office of the White House.

00:04:50.710 --> 00:04:55.650
Whatever vaccine developments happen between
now and Election Day would have nothing to

00:04:55.650 --> 00:04:58.960
do with Trump and wouldn't justify his reelection.

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:01.090
This is a really important point.

00:05:01.090 --> 00:05:05.580
Only people who want to get bamboozled by
Trump so they don't feel bad about voting

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:10.680
for him in 2016 and again in 2020 or just
straight up ignorant people are going to fall

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:11.680
for it.

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:15.550
But unfortunately, the 2016 election proves
that there are lots of people who meet that

00:05:15.550 --> 00:05:16.550
criteria.

00:05:16.550 --> 00:05:22.300
Thus, we have to get out there and make sure
we get every single vote.

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:27.819
While we hope that a vaccine is actually safely
made available as soon as possible, very important

00:05:27.819 --> 00:05:28.819
note.

00:05:28.819 --> 00:05:31.139
Nobody on the left wants people to die.

00:05:31.139 --> 00:05:34.800
Nobody on the left wants the economy to fail
to hurt Trump.

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:38.090
Trump has already justified his immediate
removal.

00:05:38.090 --> 00:05:43.729
Again, if he cures cancer and ends a climate
change by November, come and talk to me.

00:05:43.729 --> 00:05:46.759
But his actions already justify his immediate
removal.

